    <Consumed_MooGirlPudding.stages.0.description>甜甜的，香浓又入口即化，好吃</Consumed_MooGirlPudding.stages.0.description>
    <!-- fresh cheese -->
    <Consumed_MooGirlCheese.stages.0.label>新鲜奶酪</Consumed_MooGirlCheese.stages.0.label>
    <!-- Slightly chewy, melting into a rich liquid in the mouth as the milky fragrance gently coats the tongue. -->
    <Consumed_MooGirlCheese.stages.0.description>有点嚼劲，在嘴里慢慢融化成香浓的液态时，那股奶香会温柔的包裹舌头</Consumed_MooGirlCheese.stages.0.description>
    <!-- aged cheese -->
    <Consumed_MooGirlAgedCheese.stages.0.label>陈年奶酪</Consumed_MooGirlAgedCheese.stages.0.label>
    <!-- Harder than fresh cheese at first bite, then melting into a mellow sweetness that clings to the tongue without becoming cloying. -->
    <Consumed_MooGirlAgedCheese.stages.0.description>入口时嚼起来比起新鲜奶酪更硬一点，在口中融化时能尝到那股醇厚香甜的味道缠在舌头上，甜而不腻</Consumed_MooGirlAgedCheese.stages.0.description>
    <!-- rich milk flavor -->
    <Consumed_MooGirlRichMilkFlavor.stages.0.label>浓郁奶味</Consumed_MooGirlRichMilkFlavor.stages.0.label>
