    <Consumed_MooGirlRichMilkFlavor.stages.0.description>雪牛娘奶那甜甜的浓郁奶味在口腔内回荡</Consumed_MooGirlRichMilkFlavor.stages.0.description>
    <!-- tasty milk candy -->
    <Consumed_MooGirlMilkCandy.stages.0.label>好吃哒奶糖</Consumed_MooGirlMilkCandy.stages.0.label>
